8479.patch","merged_at":"2025-11-14T20:28:28Z"},"body":"In the inspector, the Copy/Paste Value feature in a property's context menu is implemented via an internal property clipboard. This is because the value copied is a Variant instead of a simple string.\r\n\r\nCurrently each `EditorInspector` instance has a property clipboard. However, it is always the property clipboard of the Inspector dock's instance that is used by the copy/paste feature for all properties. This usage is necessary because we need to support pasting across different `EditorInspector` instances.\r\n\r\nThis PR makes the property clipboard a static member of `EditorInspector`.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108479/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108479/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}